    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "E7F35075027569C6",
      "text": "新葉喵、呆火鱷、潤水鴨，\\n這３隻是比較容易照顧的寶可夢，\\c\\n所以牠們才會被學院指定為\\n交給新生的寶可夢喔。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
