    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "E7F3517502756B79",
      "text": "我們並沒有為尋寶設定確切的期限。\\c\\n還請[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳繼續享受\\n只屬於自己的大冒險喔。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
